## Tracing

OpenTelemetry runs at startup when `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` is set. Leave
it empty to disable tracing without contacting an exporter. `OTEL_SERVICE_NAME`
and `OTEL_ENVIRONMENT` label the exported spans. FastAPI requests are
instrumented, and SQLAlchemy and Redis calls are instrumented when those
features are selected.

```sh
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318/v1/traces uv run fastapi dev src/{{ spec.package }}/main.py
```
{% endif %}

