### Integration tests

`tests/integration/` uses Testcontainers to start PostgreSQL 17 and Redis 7. The
tests are skipped unless `RUN_INTEGRATION=1` is set, so the normal test suite
does not require Docker. Run them with:

```sh
bash scripts/run_integration.sh
```

The script sets `RUN_INTEGRATION=1` and selects the `integration` marker. The
`Integration` GitHub Actions workflow is manual (`workflow_dispatch`) and runs the
same script.
